  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lsa 103.02 Composition of the Board. Pursuant to RSA 310-A:142, I the board shall consist of 5 members who meet the eligibility requirements of RSA 310-A:142, I, II or both.\n\nSource. #8858, eff 3-28-07",
